# storage directory
#
# This directory holds temporary files used during processing.
# Subdirectories created by future modules:
#
#   storage/screenshots/   — payment screenshots uploaded by users
#   storage/cache/         — OCR result cache
#   storage/downloads/     — digital products awaiting delivery
#   storage/processing/    — files currently being processed
#
# All files here are TRANSIENT.
# Do not store permanent data here — use Supabase Storage for that.
#
# This file ensures the directory is tracked by git.
